  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan recalls that Dream Travel is in the hands of the Northern Plains Gu Immortal Lady Poison Scorpion, who lies dormant in Zi Du blessed land. She is the first Gu Immortal who used Dream Travel to explore dream realms, and later becomes the third overlord of dream realms under a lone cultivator identity.",
        "chapters": [
          734
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "holder",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "reg_northern_plains",
          "sys_gu_immortal",
          "char_lady_poison_scorpion",
          "loc_zi_du_blessed_land"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "It is dream travel Immortal Gu, and later text compares it with dream wings Immortal Gu: dream wings does not require immortal essence to activate, which suits cultivators who have yet to become Gu Immortals.",
        "chapters": [
          911
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "dream-travel-immortal-gu-comparison",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_immortal_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Dream Wings and Dream Travel alone are not enough to make dream path a mature path.",
        "chapters": [
          983
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "dream-path-maturity-talk",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Even with five hundred years of memories, Fang Yuan wonders what Dream Travel and Dream Wings look like. He still places dream travel Immortal Gu with Lady Poison Scorpion. In that previous-life frame, Dream Travel, Carefree Travel, Fixed Immortal Travel, and Liquor God Travel are the publicly recognized four great movement Immortal Gu, and Lady Poison Scorpion can travel through dreams and instantly enter any single dream realm.",
        "chapters": [
          2088
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-still-unknown",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
